# Strength of the Harvest is a modal double-faced card (CR 712.3): played as its back face it is the land Haven of the Harvest, which
# enters tapped (so it taps for nothing the turn it arrives) and on the next turn taps for green or white.

[Bot1 Deck]
Strength of the Harvest
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Strength of the Harvest.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Haven of the Harvest.Tapped = true
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Haven of the Harvest.Activate(Color: White)
? Bot1.Mana = {W}

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Haven of the Harvest
Bot1.Battlefield.Haven of the Harvest.Types = Land
